# Flutter state

- Providers in `lib/providers/`. Override services only in `main.dart` `ProviderScope`.
- Codegen: `dart run build_runner build --delete-conflicting-outputs`.
- Keep custom `fromJson` on `User`, `Workspace`, `Board` (API is `snake_case`).
- Tokens and last workspace via `StorageService`. Never store passwords.
- `ConfigService` URL order: Hive → Firebase REST → `assets/config.json` → localhost.
- New HTTP methods belong on `ApiService` (`_handleResponse` + `ApiError`), not ad-hoc `http` calls.
